795
00:59:12,597 --> 00:59:15,032
Go ahead .

796
00:59:15,100 --> 00:59:17,864
Aren 't you even going to try to stop me ?

797
00:59:17,936 --> 00:59:20,427
It would be easier to stop Karswell 's demon ...

798
00:59:20,507 --> 00:59:22,975
