800
00:59:48,172 --> 00:59:51,609
If anybody finds you there , the charge will be burglary .

801
00:59:51,676 --> 00:59:54,338
Karswell is away . His mother told me .

802
00:59:54,412 --> 00:59:57,245
If you find a reception committee waiting for you ...

803
