A very fashionable name for English cats in the Middle Ages .

825
01:05:52,728 --> 01:05:55,629
- They were used in witchcraft . - It was not that cat .

826
01:05:55,698 --> 01:05:58,361
Oh , yes , it was . You must have awakened him .

827
01:05:58,435 --> 01:06:00,435
You shouldn 't have , at the time of the full moon ...

828
01:06:00,503 --> 01:06:02,529
