829
01:06:02,607 --> 01:06:05,303
Oh , yes . They do dance . I 've seen them .

830
01:06:05,376 --> 01:06:10,007
- You really are crazy , aren 't you ? - On the contrary . You seem unhinged .

831
01:06:10,082 --> 01:06:14,452
Is breaking into my house to read my scribbles an indication of sanity ?

832
01:06:14,520 --> 01:06:17,546
- I was talked into that . - Ah , Miss Harrington , no doubt ...

833
01:06:17,624 --> 01:06:19,649
that horribly bright young woman .

834
01:06:20,961 --> 01:06:24,192
- I don 't think she 'd be flattered . - At least her head isn 't in the sand .

835
01:06:24,265 --> 01:06:26,733
She believes that she can see . She can .

836
01:06:26,801 --> 01:06:29,099
