863
01:10:19,237 --> 01:10:21,729
- But there 's so little time ! - If what you say is true .

864
01:10:21,807 --> 01:10:24,298
- But it is ! All of it ! - Doctor ...

865
01:10:24,377 --> 01:10:28,678
I don 't think Scotland Yard can be anything but an interested spectator .

866
01:10:28,749 --> 01:10:31,684
- I see your point . - You mean , Uncle , you have a victim ?

867
01:10:31,752 --> 01:10:34,813
