882
01:11:21,743 --> 01:11:23,905
Thought he was being followed by something or other .

883
01:11:23,980 --> 01:11:26,220
Thought he was going to die on a certain night at 1 0 : 00 .

884
01:11:26,248 --> 01:11:27,459
Did he ?

885
01:11:27,483 --> 01:11:30,078
