891
01:11:51,211 --> 01:11:54,670
When I was a kid , I used to walk down the street with the other kids .

892
01:11:54,749 --> 01:11:57,240
When we 'd come to a ladder , they 'd all walk around it .

893
01:11:57,318 --> 01:12:01,050
