926
01:13:51,150 --> 01:13:54,314
Dr. Holden has just left for the day . I 'm sorry .

927
01:13:54,387 --> 01:13:56,265
Hmm ? She 's hung up .

928
01:13:56,289 --> 01:13:58,724
Karswell 's working his mother overtime .

929
01:13:58,793 --> 01:14:00,793
Let 's go , shall we ?

930
01:14:17,648 --> 01:14:20,981
Hello ? Oh , yes , Mrs. Karswell .

931
01:14:21,051 --> 01:14:24,988
I 've tried to get Mr. Holden all day , but he won 't take a call .

932
01:14:25,056 --> 01:14:27,718
I thought perhaps you could get through to him .

933
01:14:27,792 --> 01:14:30,057
Believe me , I was as much surprised ...

934
